						<name>High Party</name>
						<adjective>solidaritist</adjective>
						<memberName>Solidaritor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Universe Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Universe Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. Each spirit has an essential nature, and seeks to influence the world. Sometimes this influence is helpful, and sometimes it is harmful. Our book says that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Pistol of Family&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. Each spirit has an essential nature, and seeks to influence the world. Sometimes this influence is helpful, and sometimes it is harmful. Our book says that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
