					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Sophiamunda</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Sophian Path</name>
						<adjective>oneist</adjective>
						<memberName>Oneist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. In the end, the archotechs will depart. They will bring a select few humans with them, and leave the rest behind to suffer.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotechs' demand is simple: Follow their designated path, and no other. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. In the end, the archotechs will depart. They will bring a select few humans with them, and leave the rest behind to suffer.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Sophian</culture>
						<iconDef>SpiralsB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkMauve</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.850, 0.850, 0.750, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
