					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>AturaStation</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Lootism</name>
						<adjective>lootist</adjective>
						<memberName>Looter</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"In my daily visitations with the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;prairie dog&lt;/color&gt;s I learned to truly listen to them. Over and over, in their own way, they repeated their message to me: You only have the right to what you can defend. No one can argue with that."

  - Bert Boyce, from the keynote to The Ultimate Raiding Forum</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"In my daily visitations with the %%animal0_thingDef_label%%s I learned to truly listen to them. Over and over, in their own way, they repeated their message to me: You only have the right to what you can defend. No one can argue with that."

  - Bert Boyce, from the keynote to The Ultimate Raiding Forum</descriptionTemplate>
