					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Chelis</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Lerebrin</name>
									<type>Creator of Life</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_TheistAbstract</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Chelisi Faith</name>
						<adjective>dominant</adjective>
						<memberName>Dominator</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the arid world Chelis worshipped &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lerebrin&lt;/color&gt;. She saw that they were suited for dominance, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. A group of sand-warriors arose under a terrible chief. They trapped the Dominators in a single water center. A hero named Peza Abruen tried to assassinate the chief. She failed, but &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lerebrin&lt;/color&gt; witnessed Peza's struggle, and anointed her as the prophet of the Dominators. Peza sacrificed herself to personally kill the chief.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the arid world Chelis worshipped %%deity0_name%%. %%Deity0_pronoun%% saw that they were suited for dominance, and ordained that these worshippers would rule above all others. A group of sand-warriors arose under a terrible chief. They trapped the %%memberNamePlural%% in a single water center. A hero named Peza Abruen tried to assassinate the chief. She failed, but %%deity0_name%% witnessed Peza's struggle, and anointed her as the prophet of the %%memberNamePlural%%. Peza sacrificed herself to personally kill the chief.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
