					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Novaroma</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Asi</name>
									<type>Goddess of Starships</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Shipborn</relatedMeme>
								</li>
								<li>
									<name>Banainos</name>
									<type>God of Life</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_TheistEmbodied</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Empty Starship</name>
						<adjective>Asiic</adjective>
						<memberName>Asiite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Templar</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Templar</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>On the planetoid Novaroma, during the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Asi's Funeral&lt;/color&gt;, people would come to the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Altar of Asi&lt;/color&gt; at the pantheon of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Asi&lt;/color&gt; and pray with space in their hearts. When Asiites began to fulfill &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Asi&lt;/color&gt;'s vision, a traitorous high-underlord moved to prevent them. His undertroops wielded cruel knifes against those who tried to board the holy ships. A renowned retail worker named Allie 'Shortie' Janzen brought the Asiites together, and even recruited some of the undertroops. Shortie gathered the Asiites in a gated suburb and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Asi&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>On the planetoid Novaroma, during the %%ritual0_name%%, people would come to the %%altar0_name%% at the %%altarRoomLabel%% of %%deity0_name%% and pray with space in their hearts. When %%memberNamePlural%% began to fulfill %%deity0_name%%'s vision, a traitorous high-underlord moved to prevent them. His undertroops wielded cruel knifes against those who tried to board the holy ships. A renowned retail worker named Allie 'Shortie' Janzen brought the %%memberNamePlural%% together, and even recruited some of the undertroops. Shortie gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a gated suburb and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>GeometryE</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.570, 0.470, 0.290, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistEmbodied</li>
							<li>Shipborn</li>
						</memes>
