						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Whiphand</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paustus&lt;/color&gt; burned in the depths of space and time for an eternity, and his screams brought forth our reality. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paustus&lt;/color&gt; hung ten thousand years on the pyre as the pain purified his spirit. Across the vast stellar distances, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Paustus&lt;/color&gt;'s will sustained the life of mankind against the void.</description>
